{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 39, "ref": "1-kings 20:39", "book": "1-kings", "lang": "qu", "chapter": 20, "translation": "Chaymi karqan: apu purirqan, payqa apuman qaparirqan, nispa: «Ñuqap yano⟨את⟩ kayki awqanapap ukhunman lluqsirqani; chayñas huk runa ñarirqan, huk runata ñuqaman apamurqan, nispam: Kay runata waqaychay; sichus chinkakapunman, chinkaptinmi ñuqap nefeshniyki paypa nefeshninllawan kanqa, utaq kikar qullqita churanqanki.»", "tokens": [{"surface": "ויהי", "gloss": "Chaymi karqan"}, {"surface": "המלך", "gloss": "apu"}, {"surface": "עבר", "gloss": "purirqan"}, {"surface": "והוא", "gloss": "payqa"}, {"surface": "צעק", "gloss": "qaparirqan"}, {"surface": "אל", "gloss": "-man"}, {"surface": "המלך", "gloss": "apuman"}, {"surface": "ויאמר", "gloss": "nirqan"}, {"surface": "עבדך", "gloss": "ñuqap yanokayki"}, {"surface": "יצא", "gloss": "lluqsirqani"}, {"surface": "בקרב", "gloss": "ukhunman"}, {"surface": "המלחמה", "gloss": "awqanapap"}, {"surface": "והנה", "gloss": "chayñas"}, {"surface": "איש", "gloss": "huk runa"}, {"surface": "סר", "gloss": "ñarirqan"}, {"surface": "ויבא", "gloss": "apamurqan"}, {"surface": "אלי", "gloss": "ñuqaman"}, {"surface": "איש", "gloss": "huk runata"}, {"surface": "ויאמר", "gloss": "nispa"}, {"surface": "שמר", "gloss": "waqaychay"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "kay runata"}, {"surface": "האיש", "gloss": "kay runa"}, {"surface": "הזה", "gloss": "kay"}, {"surface": "אם", "gloss": "sichus"}, {"surface": "הפקד", "gloss": "chinkakapunman"}, {"surface": "יפקד", "gloss": "chinkaptin"}, {"surface": "והיתה", "gloss": "kanqa"}, {"surface": "נפשך", "gloss": "ñuqap nefeshniyki"}, {"surface": "תחת", "gloss": "-llawan"}, {"surface": "נפשו", "gloss": "paypa nefeshnin"}, {"surface": "או", "gloss": "utaq"}, {"surface": "ככר", "gloss": "kikar"}, {"surface": "כסף", "gloss": "qullqi"}, {"surface": "תשקול", "gloss": "churanqanki"}], "timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:43:31.985878532Z", "model": "glm-5.3"}